DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 reference parity (ours, 17.10.2026). The 1017 checkpoint ships DeepSeek's corrected reference
(inference/model.py, encoding/encoding.py identical to V4.1 main after Oct 12/16), which our pin predates:
1. wo_a: o is FP8 quantized+dequantized (32 values per ue8m0 scale, e4m3) before the einsum (act_quant(..., True)) -
   added on the EXL3 grouped_bmm path of deep_gemm_fp8_o_proj (VLLM_DSV41_WOA_FP8_ACT=1, 0 = old behaviour).
2. encoder: user messages that only carry tool results do not start a new turn (find_last_user_index), so the
   reasoning of a tool loop is kept; structured tool content (content_blocks) / list user content are passed through.
The reference's indexer owns_k guard fixes the reference itself; vLLM keeps index keys per kv_source layer already.

diff --git a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/o_proj.py b/vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/o_proj.py
index e5232dce4..f4543ee17 100644
--- a/vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/o_proj.py
+++ b/vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/o_proj.py
@@ -74,6 +74,10 @@ def deep_gemm_fp8_o_proj(
             tma_aligned_scales=tma_aligned_scales,
             quantize=False,
         )
+        if _WOA_FP8_ACT:
+            # DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash reference since Oct 12 2026 (1017 ships it): o is block-wise FP8
+            # quantized and dequantized (32 activations per ue8m0 scale) before the wo_a einsum.
+            o_rot = _fp8_qdq_ue8m0(o_rot)
         return wo_b(grouped_bmm(o_rot).flatten(1))
     if getattr(wo_a, "sm12x_bmm_groups", None) and not isinstance(
         o, QuantizedActivation
@@ -197,3 +201,19 @@ def rope_quant_attn_out(num_tokens: int, device: torch.device) -> QuantizedActiv
         orig_shape=data.shape,
         quant_key=kFp8Dynamic128Sym,
     )
+
+# --- DSV4.1-1017 reference parity (dsv41 recipe patch 0030) --------------------------------------------
+import os as _os
+
+_WOA_FP8_ACT = _os.environ.get("VLLM_DSV41_WOA_FP8_ACT", "1") == "1"
+
+
+def _fp8_qdq_ue8m0(x: torch.Tensor, group_size: int = 32) -> torch.Tensor:
+    """act_quant(x, 32, "ue8m0", e8m0, inplace=True) of DeepSeek's inference/kernel.py in torch:
+    per 32 values amax (min 1e-4), scale = 2**ceil(log2(amax / 448)), e4m3 round trip, back to x.dtype."""
+    shape = x.shape
+    xf = x.float().reshape(*shape[:-1], shape[-1] // group_size, group_size)
+    amax = xf.abs().amax(dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp_min(1e-4)
+    scale = torch.exp2(torch.ceil(torch.log2(amax * (1.0 / 448.0))))
+    y = (xf / scale).clamp(-448.0, 448.0).to(torch.float8_e4m3fn).float() * scale
+    return y.reshape(shape).to(x.dtype)
